OL,3,GNEWSAObjections raised over quarry
OL,4,Aredevelopment plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have raised concerns that
OL,7,Fplans to redevelop a quarry would
OL,8,Fincrease the number of lorries on roads
OL,9,Faround their village.
OL,11,FTarmac Aggregates Ltd has submitted
OL,12,Fplans for a waste processing facility,
OL,13,Fa ready-mix concrete plant, solar farm
OL,14,Fand battery energy storage system at
OL,15,FShawell quarry, near Lutterworth in
OL,16,FLeicestershire.
OL,18,FResidents in Shawell have said traffic
OL,19,Flevels at the quarry reduced when sand
OL,20,Fand gravel reserves neared exhaustion.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
